  "description": "A lightweight, pure C# .NET MAUI library for accepting eSewa payments via\n      the current eSewa ePay v2 hosted checkout (HMAC-signed). No native SDK\n      binding — it opens the hosted eSewa payment page in a WebView, verifies\n      the signed response, and returns a normalized result through a single\n      cross-platform API: EsewaEpay.Current.PayAsync(...).",
